msgid "Creates a barrier around target that absorbs damage equivalent to a heal of 2,500 potency.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Adds a <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lily</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to your <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Healing Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> if the barrier is completely absorbed"
