msgid "Doubles the number of strikes for a single-target weaponskill. Additional effects added only once.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of both <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Army's Paeon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Repertoire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
