msgid "Deals damage with a potency of 600,000 to all objects near point of impact. 30,000 when attacking opposing players, warmachina, or mammets.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 3s"
