msgid "Delivers damage with a potency of 80,000 to all opposing players and warmachina in a straight line before you. 8,000 when attacking a mammet or object.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30-yalm knockback"
